%% title: Which way a family's application goes
%% desc: A parent or student submits an application. By type, it goes to the class teacher, the headmaster or the office. Before a decision, whoever submitted it can withdraw it. When it is approved or rejected, the family gets a notification.
flowchart LR
  A["You submit<br/>(Pending)"] --> S["School step<br/>class teacher / headmaster / office"]
  S --> Y["Approved"]:::done
  S --> N["Rejected"]:::no
  A -. "before a decision" .-> W["Withdraw"]
  Y --> B["Notification"]
  N --> B
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef no fill:#fff5f5,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#5c1111
